# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
ai-cli
ai-cli.exe
eos
eos.exe

# Vendored Rust sidecar release artifacts.
# 目录由 binaries/ 改名为 core/（见 commit bdaab40），白名单必须匹配实际路径，
# 否则 *.exe 通配会把 vendored 内核二进制忽略掉（git clean / 重 add 时丢失）。
!pkg/coreapi/sidecar/core/**/eos-core.exe

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
.trae/
.claude/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
nul

# Log files
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# Build output
dist/
output/
build/
release/
dev/

# Runtime data
.eos.json
.eos/
internal/.eos/
**/.eos/
**/.eos/**

# Local secrets/config
.env
.env.*
*.local.json

# 签名私钥（CI 落盘 / 本机 dev-rebuild 使用）——绝不能入库
*.pem
scripts/eos-signing-key.pem
**/eos-signing-key.pem

# 测试污染产物（/init 写文件、临时脚本）——杂散文件不入库
/internal/ui/EOS.md
/internal/ui/md

/docs/

# 本地工作笔记与 agent 工具目录（不入库）
/.workbuddy/
/TECH_ROADMAP.md
